{"steam_appid":1910150,"steam_name":"Walk of Life","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1910150/1760952085/4553044e68ae6c5f218ca603541110347efa9cf0/1777566537/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777567706","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257329530/d7035f3febd875ec76e44b4b769aa8c83f962352/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777567706","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/0c70af7c915b9aa9234783dd60135ac7b3abcc2a/ss_0c70af7c915b9aa9234783dd60135ac7b3abcc2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784826288","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/6c16cb4f0110149f42d98ce13fa7dada14c3d31f/ss_6c16cb4f0110149f42d98ce13fa7dada14c3d31f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784826288","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/fc34e6e7de88eb1d540e89043cb6e81a5aa547c8/ss_fc34e6e7de88eb1d540e89043cb6e81a5aa547c8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784826288","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/aaa95a2a74db04f51d317e3551ecf8b05bbac3a7/ss_aaa95a2a74db04f51d317e3551ecf8b05bbac3a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784826288","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/f210e091c4023dcd2c1734510f6d7588bb455c0f/ss_f210e091c4023dcd2c1734510f6d7588bb455c0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784826288"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/14186dd62d2f4eddaae4ec4f2b089dc9.poster.avif?t=1784826288\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/14186dd62d2f4eddaae4ec4f2b089dc9.webm?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/14186dd62d2f4eddaae4ec4f2b089dc9.mp4?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk of Life is the ultimate competitive life simulator! Play with up to six players and do whatever it takes to make it to the top! Dive headfirst into the rat race and crush your friends (or our stupid bot players!) in Walk of Life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/58fd7f041cdcb1c98b26a198c11baa0e.avif?t=1784826288\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your best to juggle your health, education, career and personal hygiene, all while dodging the hilarious curveballs life throws your way! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or bots in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who’s the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/caf65be2ad42866620dac34270c6d552.poster.avif?t=1784826288\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/caf65be2ad42866620dac34270c6d552.webm?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/caf65be2ad42866620dac34270c6d552.mp4?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3509de6638b7f6fa503de9bd33280435.avif?t=1784826288\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opulence! The artistry! The swag! Decorate your apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams ‘success in life’ like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! How multifaceted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3613a028f10280f1392d72abe12db09d.poster.avif?t=1784826288\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3613a028f10280f1392d72abe12db09d.webm?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3613a028f10280f1392d72abe12db09d.mp4?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/5376efa6a3608ba70923b69dc02b361e.avif?t=1784826288\" width=780 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Will you climb to the top of the corporate ladder as the Workaholic, scrounge up valuable artifacts as the Scavenger, or follow your horoscopes as the Mystic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/b172712b4eab4ecfcc66bfdf864eeb06.avif?t=1784826288\" width=780 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/b97a4201c7adb64e2313ef07fa3238cc.avif?t=1784826288\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a look at the animations in the Arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/6a6bc4e33a78834ace239016d27dfa95.poster.avif?t=1784826288\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/6a6bc4e33a78834ace239016d27dfa95.webm?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/6a6bc4e33a78834ace239016d27dfa95.mp4?t=1784826288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core 4Ghz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel UHD Graphics 630, Geforce GTX 750 Ti or Radeon RX 550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Drive</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12500, AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060, AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Drive</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Porcelain Fortress"],"publishers":["Porcelain Fortress"],"release_date":"Apr 30, 2026"}